# EGBOS Production Parameter Registry
# Status: Authoritative
# This file enumerates every numerical parameter used in production
# feature computation. A parameter MUST appear here before it may be
# referenced in engine/ code. Each entry cites its ratification source.

# Format:
#   feature_id   : hex feature ID (0x0000 = reserved)
#   feature_name : human-readable name
#   parameter    : parameter name (as used in code / governance claim)
#   value        : exact numerical value (machine-representable)
#   type         : C++ type used in production code
#   source       : governance document that authorised this value
#   code_ref     : file and constant/variable name in production code

---

entries:

